    "detailed_description": "Try to survive the increasing waves of alien thingies! Unlock and upgrade guns, pickup power-ups, get Steam achievements. Have fun with this brainless shooter game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControl: Keyboard and mouse.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTips: <br />\r\n- you should visit often the circle at the center for useful gifts. <br />\r\n- first buy the revolver,  it's unlocked from the first moment. <br />\r\n- weapon upgrades and ammos get more expensive from wave to wave so don't save golds.<br />\r\n- hedshot causes double damage<br />\r\n- their energy and power increasing from wave te wave, don't let them touch you at all!",
